ld #D7AFFF]                     [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]timeline[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]timeline: add a pure pomodoro_timeline module that turns today's ledger [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]into numbered segments (closed Pomodoros, gaps, tail, head, walls) and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]lays a run of windows out from a pin with exact, capped, and cut [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]lengths; heavily unit-tested, not yet wired.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Segment suffix lexer, pins, spans, and teaching errors[/bold #D7AFFF]        [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]grammar[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]grammar: lex the optional suffix at the end of E, carry it on [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]PomodoroPastSpec, compute one pin per run with misplaced/double-pin [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]diagnostics, emit the pomodoro_past_segment span and capture-parse JSON,[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and replace the old ~/dash teaching errors; execution refuses suffixed [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]tokens until record lands.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Record pinned runs end to end and ship grammar 14[/bold #D7AFFF]             [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]record[dim] · [dim][/dim]after timeline, grammar[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]record: wire the timeline and layout into plan.rs for pinned runs [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF](snapshot first, unpinned runs untouched), add guard hints and the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]same-capture trim rule, report segment and cut in capture JSON and human[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]output, document the feature, and bump the grammar to 14.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Segment picker, dash-to-tilde rewrite, and submit guards[/bold #D7AFFF]      [bold black on #FFD75F] 